/** What one status event records. issued: the assessment was issued; superseded: a newer assessment (successor) replaces it; invalidated: a listed change made it stale (results are never rewritten); withdrawn: the issuer no longer stands behind the claim. Key revocation (key log) and expiry (the claim's expires_ms) are not status changes. */
